WEBVTT

00:04.230 --> 00:06.460
Kazuma's absent again, huh?

00:06.460 --> 00:08.580
It's his fourth unexcused absence in a row.

00:08.580 --> 00:10.660
Has it been that long?

00:10.660 --> 00:12.590
I'm a little worried.

00:12.590 --> 00:13.380
Yup.

00:13.380 --> 00:15.940
No, this is unforgivable.

00:16.910 --> 00:21.750
Kazuma does not comprehend his role 
as the fellow student of a supreme being.

00:21.750 --> 00:22.700
Yup.

00:22.700 --> 00:23.490
Huh?

00:23.490 --> 00:25.390
It's fine now.

00:28.940 --> 00:31.340
You're coming to school arm-in-arm?

00:31.340 --> 00:36.050
No! I brought Kazuma 'cause 
he refuses to listen to me.

00:37.000 --> 00:39.290
Okay, I came to school as promised.

00:39.290 --> 00:42.420
Now, I'll be going home early.

00:40.920 --> 00:43.070
I don't know what this 
"game" you're so into is,

00:43.070 --> 00:44.690
but stop being stupid!

00:44.690 --> 00:46.850
It's time for class!

00:46.850 --> 00:50.460
I can't miss this event, though!

00:51.100 --> 00:52.360
Does he mean...

00:52.690 --> 00:55.780
Kazuma, are you playing that game?

00:55.780 --> 00:57.330
That's right.

00:57.330 --> 00:59.530
There's a new skin today.

00:59.530 --> 01:01.080
Wait, Ains?!

01:01.080 --> 01:02.410
You're playing, too?

01:04.960 --> 01:08.450
Do you know about the Cult of Diablos? (No) 
Episode 8: Popular! Online Game

01:06.530 --> 01:08.090
Sheesh...

01:08.450 --> 01:09.980
Episode 8: Popular! Online Game

01:08.460 --> 01:11.180
I managed to get him here.

01:11.590 --> 01:15.760
But there's not much point if 
he just falls asleep in class.

01:15.760 --> 01:20.030
Let's give him credit for coming, at least.

01:20.030 --> 01:23.470
You're quite forgiving of Kazuma, Megumin.

01:23.470 --> 01:27.020
Am I? I think I'm pretty harsh with him.

01:27.020 --> 01:29.610
No, you're being too nice.

01:29.610 --> 01:32.820
I'm shocked he was playing Jörmguld, though.

01:32.820 --> 01:35.970
Ains-sama, what is Jörmguld?

01:36.330 --> 01:41.800
It's a newly launched full-experience MMORPG.

01:41.800 --> 01:48.150
It has a huge world, with countless routes 
to explore, and a ton of skins.

01:48.850 --> 01:51.000
You know a lot about it.

01:51.000 --> 01:53.050
I'm playing it, too.

01:53.050 --> 01:56.270
But you come to school every day.

01:56.270 --> 01:58.120
You're much better.

01:58.120 --> 02:00.360
Well, I'm undead.

02:00.360 --> 02:02.620
I don't need to sleep,
 which helps me...

02:02.620 --> 02:04.520
Huh? No fair!

02:05.060 --> 02:07.750
I'm human, so I have to cut 
into my sleeping time!

02:07.750 --> 02:09.750
But Ains, you don't have to?!

02:09.750 --> 02:12.400
That's the wrong thing 
to be angry about, Kazuma.

02:12.400 --> 02:14.020
That's right.

02:14.020 --> 02:18.750
There are other humans who play the 
game but come to school every day.

02:18.750 --> 02:20.610
Oh, yeah? Where?!

02:20.610 --> 02:21.630
Right here!

02:23.630 --> 02:26.050
I play Jörmguld, too.

02:26.440 --> 02:28.060
Are you pretty into it?

02:28.740 --> 02:29.830
I'd say so, yeah.

02:30.230 --> 02:32.550
You play it all night?

02:32.910 --> 02:35.920
I've barely slept at all 
during this week's event.

02:36.270 --> 02:38.430
You're really into it.

02:38.430 --> 02:41.180
That explains why you look so grumpy.

02:41.180 --> 02:43.140
No, he always looks like this.

02:43.580 --> 02:45.650
Are you mocking me?

02:47.940 --> 02:50.580
I just love how realistic it is!

02:50.580 --> 02:55.150
Me, too! I love how you can't 
go back once you pick a route.

02:55.150 --> 02:58.780
Yes. You know it's better to kill 
them and take their stuff, but...

02:58.780 --> 02:59.570
But you just can't!

02:59.570 --> 03:03.410
Really? I don't have any hesitation 
in killing a character.

03:03.410 --> 03:05.340
Some people are pure min-maxers.

03:05.340 --> 03:06.340
You're inhuman!

03:06.340 --> 03:07.960
Well, I'm undead.

03:07.960 --> 03:11.800
Oh, but the Japanese pack was great.

03:08.460 --> 03:11.800
They're so excited that there's 
no room for me to interrupt.

03:11.800 --> 03:15.920
Yeah, you know it doesn't fit into 
the world, but it's still so cool.

03:11.800 --> 03:14.540
Yes. Let's go.

03:14.540 --> 03:16.520
Yes, let's ditch them.

03:17.270 --> 03:22.810
Yes! Yes! The Japanese equipment was 
so cool that I actually bought some.

03:22.810 --> 03:25.170
What kind of skin do you 
have for your character?

03:25.170 --> 03:28.130
Me? I've got a military outfit right now.

03:28.130 --> 03:30.270
That outfit is so cool.

03:30.270 --> 03:32.980
Yes. It appeals to my tastes.

03:32.980 --> 03:34.520
I get it!

03:34.520 --> 03:36.010
What about you, Naofumi?

03:36.010 --> 03:37.690
I've got a Japanese skin.

03:37.960 --> 03:40.270
Yeah, miko outfits are great.

03:40.270 --> 03:41.750
I get it!

03:41.750 --> 03:44.450
You definitely want a miko outfit!

03:45.480 --> 03:48.250
I don't... use the miko outfit.

03:48.250 --> 03:49.660
Why?

03:50.030 --> 03:52.690
Well, because... I don't...

03:52.690 --> 03:55.920
It reminds me of someone specific.

03:56.260 --> 03:57.730
What do you mean?

03:57.730 --> 03:59.660
Enough about that!

04:01.010 --> 04:02.450
Naofumi-sama!

04:02.450 --> 04:04.010
Raphtalia! Filo!

04:04.010 --> 04:06.760
Master! Let's eat lunch!

04:06.760 --> 04:10.680
Yeah. Let's talk later, guys.

04:10.680 --> 04:11.370
Indeed.

04:11.370 --> 04:14.730
And no more skipping school, Kazuma.

04:14.730 --> 04:15.900
Got it.

04:15.900 --> 04:19.200
What's for lunch today, Master?

04:19.200 --> 04:20.920
I made a yakiniku lunch.

04:20.920 --> 04:22.700
Yay!

04:22.700 --> 04:24.750
With a curry pilaf.

04:26.350 --> 04:28.070
I'll put a little flag in it for you.

04:28.790 --> 04:30.660
Hooray! Hooray!

04:31.750 --> 04:33.350
What's wrong, Raphtalia?

04:33.350 --> 04:35.130
It's okay to be happy about it.

04:35.130 --> 04:38.100
Don't treat me like a child, please.

04:38.520 --> 04:40.260
Hey, Ains...

04:41.730 --> 04:45.710
Raphtalia-chan would look 
good in a miko outfit, right?

04:45.710 --> 04:46.300
Kazuma.

04:46.300 --> 04:47.750
Yes, I'm Kazuma.

04:48.310 --> 04:51.410
Let's just not talk about that.

04:51.410 --> 04:52.790
Huh? Why?

04:53.770 --> 04:56.120
Okay, got it.

04:59.250 --> 05:02.240
I never know what'll set that guy off.

05:02.240 --> 05:04.640
Maybe something happened in the past.

05:04.640 --> 05:06.450
Supreme Being...

05:06.980 --> 05:09.170
It's simple.

05:10.370 --> 05:11.950
What do you mean?

05:11.950 --> 05:13.750
This is what I mean.

05:13.750 --> 05:17.960
Naofumi tried to force Raphtalia to cosplay.

05:17.960 --> 05:25.250
And he was so forceful about it that Raphtalia 
became angry, and it traumatized him.

05:25.250 --> 05:26.270
He's a pervert, then.

05:26.270 --> 05:27.960
Yes, a pervert.

05:28.420 --> 05:29.780
That's not what happened, okay?

05:32.600 --> 05:35.850
Is the game that good?

05:35.850 --> 05:40.220
Yeah, it's not just Kazuma 
who's addicted, but Aqua, too.

05:40.220 --> 05:42.150
She's barely even sleeping these days.

05:43.300 --> 05:45.750
I don't get it at all.

05:45.750 --> 05:48.980
I'd rather play with the monsters outside.

05:48.980 --> 05:51.830
We can't actually do that.

05:51.830 --> 05:54.140
Playing with the monsters, huh?

05:54.140 --> 05:56.860
That sounds fun, Brother Otto, doesn't it?

05:56.860 --> 06:00.450
When I say "we," I don't mean Garfiel.

06:00.450 --> 06:02.060
Aw, I'm blushing!

06:02.060 --> 06:02.670
It's not a compliment!

06:02.670 --> 06:06.500
That probably doesn't apply 
to Darkness either, right?

06:07.220 --> 06:11.170
When the monsters attack her,
she looks so happy.

06:12.050 --> 06:13.300
True.

06:13.300 --> 06:16.560
Wait! Not you too, Otto-dono.

06:17.690 --> 06:20.060
Jörmguld, huh?

06:20.060 --> 06:22.460
Is it that fun?

06:22.460 --> 06:26.360
Yes. It's a pretty good game...

06:26.950 --> 06:32.530
But it's not as good as the game I loved most.

06:34.870 --> 06:39.280
Just take the maps! They're not 
nearly as big as YGGDRASIL,

06:39.280 --> 06:42.540
the game I played, and you can 
barely customize them all!

06:42.540 --> 06:46.260
The best part of YGGDRASIL is 
how much freedom the player has!

06:46.260 --> 06:47.920
You can do anything!

06:47.920 --> 06:52.050
Just think about it! 
Over 700 races and 2000 classes!

06:52.340 --> 06:56.760
And you can customize more than just 
their abilities and appearance!

06:55.780 --> 07:00.100
Sorry, I honestly have no idea 
what you're talking about.

06:56.760 --> 07:00.100
It's far more than just a combat-oriented MMO!

07:02.310 --> 07:05.860
Today's Topic: Let's Think About the Balance Between Games and Our Lives

07:02.850 --> 07:05.860
Now, as you all know,

07:05.860 --> 07:10.250
our school is experiencing 
an unprecedented gaming boom.

07:10.610 --> 07:14.610
I didn't intend to get involved with 
how individuals entertain themselves,

07:15.030 --> 07:18.490
but this rate of absences goes 
beyond what I can tolerate.

07:18.490 --> 07:19.870
That's right.

07:19.870 --> 07:23.880
You say that, but I can see that 
while you've come to school,

07:24.140 --> 07:26.200
you haevn't slept at all.

07:26.200 --> 07:30.250
You're so sharp, ma'am.
There's no fooling you.

07:32.070 --> 07:36.050
The school would prefer not to get involved,

07:36.050 --> 07:41.350
but given the situation, I think 
some kind of rule is in order.

07:41.350 --> 07:43.520
What do you think, Emilia-kun?

07:43.520 --> 07:48.760
Yes... How about only one 
hour of gaming per day?

07:48.760 --> 07:51.130
Th-That's going too far!

07:51.130 --> 07:53.860
At least six, no, eight hours!

07:54.130 --> 07:57.910
How many hours a night do you plan to sleep?

07:57.910 --> 08:02.290
If I use Time Stop, does that time not count?

08:02.290 --> 08:05.080
Please, Ains, do not be 
serious when you ask that.

08:05.080 --> 08:05.750
Yes, ma'am.

08:05.750 --> 08:11.890
Anyway, at this rate, we're going 
to have to set a time-limit rule.

08:11.890 --> 08:16.260
So everyone, please try to keep 
your entertainment within limits.

08:16.260 --> 08:16.760
Understood?

08:16.760 --> 08:18.550
Yes, sir!

08:22.700 --> 08:24.050
Sheesh.

08:24.650 --> 08:28.520
My actual life is already this complicated.

08:28.520 --> 08:32.520
Why do I have to use my head 
when I play a game, too?

08:36.700 --> 08:37.560
Well...

08:37.880 --> 08:43.230
It's important for a teacher to know 
what's popular among his students.

08:49.990 --> 08:55.260
Today's class... is... finished.

08:56.190 --> 08:58.210
R-Rerugen-sensei?

08:58.210 --> 09:00.810
Are you feeling okay?

09:01.030 --> 09:03.250
I'm... fine.

09:03.610 --> 09:07.500
But the spots under your eyes 
are getting darker by the day.

09:08.270 --> 09:11.260
No need... to worry.

09:17.540 --> 09:21.810
Okay, Ains, let's meet on the 
usual server at 11:00 PM tonight.

09:21.810 --> 09:24.600
We're using voice chat again tonight, right?

09:24.600 --> 09:29.770
Yes, that new player, 
Honey Please, is joining, too.

09:29.770 --> 09:32.580
All right. I'll tell Naofumi as well.

09:44.810 --> 09:57.030
Musasabi Nyao

09:46.340 --> 09:48.890
Honey-san isn't here yet.

09:48.890 --> 09:51.920
They play this game more than any of us.

09:51.920 --> 09:56.600
It's amazing how fast they went from 
a beginner to playing this much.

09:57.030 --> 09:59.220
Think they've got a job?

09:59.220 --> 10:02.370
No, you couldn't progress 
like that if you had a job.

09:59.470 --> 10:02.370
Musasabi

10:02.370 --> 10:07.870
Musasabi Nyao

10:03.340 --> 10:05.690
Oh, they said they're logging in.

10:06.490 --> 10:07.890
What are they like, I wonder?

10:07.890 --> 10:10.710
Musasabi Nyao

10:08.520 --> 10:15.380
Honey Please

10:11.050 --> 10:13.200
Hello, everyone.

10:13.200 --> 10:15.380
I'm Honey Please.

10:17.970 --> 10:18.930
Huh?

10:18.930 --> 10:20.550
Is this on?

10:21.170 --> 10:23.890
Can they not hear me?

10:24.110 --> 10:28.130
Um, are you Honey Please?

10:28.130 --> 10:30.990
Yes. Tanaka-san, right?

10:30.990 --> 10:32.690
Nice to meet you.

10:35.050 --> 10:36.570
Is something wrong?

10:39.960 --> 10:41.970
H-Hi there.

10:41.970 --> 10:44.530
Nice to... meet you.

10:52.070 --> 10:53.170
He turned it off.
